  "sourceText": "Herb Popcorn\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, March 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 teaspoon Salt\n1/2 teaspoon Thyme\n1 teaspoon Basil\n1 teaspoon Marjoram\n1 tablespoon Dried onion flakes\n1/2 cup Popcorn, popped\nButter to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine the salt, thyme, basil, marjoram and dried onion and mix well. Use one or two teaspoons per 1/2 cup corn, popped with butter.",
